  "gh:content": {
    "en": "Our work is to help him soften the border between himself and the world and return to the greater flow. Wu wei, ziran. Simply, to be as it is.",
    "ja": "私たちの仕事は、彼が自分と世界の境界線を融かし、大いなる流れに還る手助けをすること。無為自然。ただ、在るがままにあること。"
  },
  "gh:index": 7
}